      "culture": {
        "title": "Church in Bohol",
        "text": "Most Boholanos are Catholic and Sunday Mass is a family event. Dress neatly (no shorts or tank tops), and if you're not Catholic, stay seated during communion - nobody will mind. Bohol's old stone churches, like Baclayon, are among the oldest in the country."
      }
    },
